(ns kotoba.clj-host
  "kotoba.clj-host — clj-authored replacement for the retired Rust host
  bridge `kami-clj-host` (kami-engine, pre-clj-wgsl-migration Phase 4,
  ADR-2607010930). Concrete implementation of the `kami:engine/frame` WIT
  contract's decode half: decode the KAMI columnar render-IR that
  `kami.ipc/pack` emits.

  - [[kotoba.clj-host.frame]] — pure, GPU-free columnar decoder. Tested
    against the byte-exact fixtures emitted by the clj packer
    (`test/resources/fixtures/frame.bin`, `frame_v2.bin`) — the
    cross-language contract anchor carried over from the Rust crate's
    `#[cfg(test)]` module.

  The Rust crate's `host` module (wasm-bindgen + wgpu browser GPU driver:
  `register_mesh` / `register_material` / `register_shader` /
  `submit_frame`) is NOT ported here — it is GPU orchestration bound to
  wgpu/WebGPU, not decoder domain logic, and has no meaningful cljc
  equivalent. See README.md ADR-2607010930 notes for the concrete host
  bridge's disposition.")
